The randomized gate is slower than expected because every candidate requires dynamic component replay twice (once to keep later moves syntactically valid, once to grade it). It is still progressing normally; after this calibration I’ll remove the duplicate traversal while preserving the exact same 200,000-candidate distribution and verification result.
