+        "Track A: Lemma 1.1 at d=2, k=d+1 guarantees connectivity, but the paper "
+        "says its construction may be exponential and a polynomial bound is open; "
+        "the shipping 10x10 grid has treewidth 10, maximum degree 4, and average "
+        "degree 3.6, outside Theorems 0.1--0.3, while bounded bidirectional "
