codex
The revised family now behaves as intended on the sampled shipping seeds: the planted walk builds in under a second before heuristic filtering, while a component-deduplicated bidirectional search still generates roughly 23,000–26,000 successors per instance and finds none. I’m tightening the runtime accounting and running all gates next.
