One adversary exposed a real weakness: the 32-restart heuristic solved 1 of 8 shipping instances, so G6 correctly failed. I’ve strengthened generation against that same in-context heuristic and expanded the domain-standard bidirectional beam from width 32 to 128 (up to 120,000 generated successors per instance) before rerunning the panel.
