- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2112.02313/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2112.02313/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

External hardening remains blocked: every OpenRouter redraw returned HTTP 403 “key limit exceeded.” The transcripts retain those script-generated errors, and `submit.sh` correctly blocks submission at the transcript check. No oracle failure was misreported as a hardness success.
