    73	
    74	The bare harness reached only the first `easy` rung. Four redraws—two `openai/gpt-5.6-terra` and two `x-ai/grok-4.6`—all returned HTTP 403 before producing a reply. Per the harness contract, errors do not consume attempts and are not failures to solve; consequently there is no `hardened` or `too_easy` verdict and no defensible shipping-level oracle table yet.
