    91	
    92	```python
    93	import gen_2112_02313 as g
    94	
    95	params = g.DIFFICULTY[g.SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY]
    96	inst = g.make_instance(seed=7, **params)
    97	statement = g.render(inst)
