The paper was rejected after full-text and implementation audit.

The attempted family passes generation and exact verification, but fails H/G9(c): its claimed 225-operation route only verifies an already-known planted sequence. Recovering that sequence still required at least 220,001 component-quotient search successors, so there is no compact route distinct from the mechanical one.

